Subject: [PATCH 216/248] fix(kanban): gave_up/crashed notices name the real
 cause, retry state and owner [daveey]

A model safety refusal after minutes of work was shown as 'gave up after
repeated spawn failures' / 'worker crashed (pid gone)'. Classify refusal vs
crash vs real spawn failure vs provider config; pid/exit/raw output go under
Details only. No retry or provider-routing behaviour changes.
